$$------------------------------------------------------------------------------
$$ Quasi-isotropic laminate, single shell element  --  Altair OptiStruct
$$
$$   units : mm - N - tonne - s   (stress MPa, density 1.57-9)
$$   model : 1 x 1 mm CQUAD4, 4 plies [0/45/-45/90] x 0.125 mm = 0.5 mm
$$           membrane only (all rotations and uz fixed), pulled to ux = 0.005 mm
$$   check : laminate average sigma_x ~= 260.45 MPa, edge reaction ~= 130.23 N
$$           (CLT: E_eff = 52090.3 MPa, nu_eff = 0.30686)
$$
$$   Linear static -- the laminate is elastic at 0.5% strain, so the answer is a
$$   closed-form check.  Bulk data is Nastran-compatible; only the I/O section
$$   and the H3D output requests are OptiStruct-specific.
$$
$$   MAT8 carries the allowables (Xt Xc Yt Yc S) and PCOMP's FT selects the
$$   criterion.  Both are needed: allowables without FT, or FT without
$$   allowables, silently produces no failure index.
$$------------------------------------------------------------------------------
$$ I/O Options
SCREEN,OUT
OUTPUT,H3D
DISPLACEMENT(H3D) = ALL
STRESS(H3D)       = ALL
STRAIN(H3D)       = ALL
FORCE(H3D)        = ALL
SPCFORCE(H3D)     = ALL
CSTRESS(H3D)      = ALL
$$
$$ Subcase Information
SUBCASE 1
  LABEL    = pull to eps_x = 0.5 percent
  ANALYSIS = STATICS
  SPC      = 1
  LOAD     = 2
$$
BEGIN BULK
$
$$-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
$$ MESH
$$-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
GRID    1               0.0     0.0     0.0
GRID    2               1.0     0.0     0.0
GRID    3               1.0     1.0     0.0
GRID    4               0.0     1.0     0.0
$
$       EID     PID     G1      G2      G3      G4      THETA
CQUAD4  1       100     1       2       3       4       0.0
$
$$-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
$$ LAMINATE      PCOMP  PID  Z0  NSM  SB  FT  TREF  GE  LAM
$$-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
PCOMP   100                     60.0    TSAI    20.0
+       1       0.125   0.0     YES     1       0.125   45.0    YES
+       1       0.125   -45.0   YES     1       0.125   90.0    YES
$
$$-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
$$ PLY MATERIAL  MAT8  MID  E1  E2  NU12  G12  G1Z  G2Z  RHO
$$                     A1  A2  TREF  Xt  Xc  Yt  Yc  S
$$-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
MAT8    1       135000. 9000.   0.3     5000.   5000.   3500.   1.57-9
+       -0.5-6  28.0-6  20.0    2200.   1400.   60.0    200.0   90.0
$
$$-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
$$ BOUNDARY CONDITIONS   (membrane only + enforced displacement)
$$-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
SPC1    1       1       1       4
SPC1    1       2       1       2
SPC1    1       3456    1       2       3       4
SPC1    1       1       2       3
$
SPCD    2       2       1       0.005   3       1       0.005
$
ENDDATA
